<Mary> <people.person.quotations> "My soul doth magnify the Lord.  And my spirit rejoiceth in God my Saviour.  Because He hath looked down on the lowliness of His handmaid:  for behold henceforth all generations will call me blessed.  Because the Mighty One hath done great things for me:  and holy is His name.  And His mercy is from generation to generation:  on those who fear Him.  He showeth might in His arm:  He scattereth the proud in the conceit of their heart.  He casteth down the mighty from theirthrone:  and exalteth the lowly.  He filleth the hungry with good things:  and the rich He sendeth away empty.  He hath received His servant Israel:  being mindful of His mercy.  As He spake to our fathers:  to Abraham and to his seed forever." .
