<constantine_i_fake_donation_revealed_by_lorenzo_valla> <base.kwebbase.kwconnection.sentence> "The famous 'Donation of Constantine'  (with which the emperor was supposed to have Given Pope Sylvester I primacy over Antioch, Constantinople, Alexandria, and Jerusalem, and political control of Italy, and made the Pope supreme judge of the clergy)  was in fact an 8th-century forgery from the reign of Charlemagne, as proved in the 15th century by the humanist scholar Valla." .
